%% Public-safe sketch of the reporting rebuild (derived from Ergon).
%% Editable source for apps/website/app/components/reporting-architecture-diagram.tsx
flowchart TD
  Client[Report UI] --> API[Analytics API]
  API --> Race[Run query · 10s limit]
  Race --> MySQL[(MySQL)]
  Race -->|finishes| Inline[Return inline]
  Race -->|exceeds limit| Job[Create job record]
  Job --> SQS[SQS work queue]
  SQS --> Worker[Lambda worker]
  Worker --> S3[S3 results]
  Worker --> Status[Job status in MySQL]
  Poll[Client polls] -->|poll| Status
  Poll -->|fetch results| S3
  API -.->|metrics| CW[CloudWatch]
  SQS -.->|metrics| CW
  Worker -.->|metrics| CW
